<canvas id="view"></canvas>
<header class="create-bar">
  <strong id="worldName"></strong>
  <span id="hud"></span>
</header>
<footer class="create-hint">W/S run · A/D turn · Q/E strafe · space takes off, then rises · shift drops · double-tap space or shift to go fast · left-drag looks around · right-drag turns · wheel zooms</footer>
<div id="open" hidden>
  <p>Open a version 2 world zip. <code>node script/convert-v2.mjs</code> makes one from a version 1 world.</p>
  <input id="openFile" type="file" accept=".zip,application/zip">
  <p id="openError"></p>
</div>
